   "k": "19t1jtm",
   "en": "If you want to use ⟦0⟧ and use the air wings to operate standard ⟦1⟧, then they will no longer operate automatically as a Carrier Air Group and if the carrier fleet is engaged by the enemy, it may not have air cover. The player should be careful to make sure that it is properly protected. One might place a fighter wing on an interception mission in the region where the carrier fleet is located, but send a bomber wing to target an adjoining region, for example, to support an amphibious landing. In order to send carrier-based air wings on standard ⟦2⟧, including ⟦3⟧ to help train them up for battle, their carrier(s) must be at sea (not in a port) and must not be on any ⟦4⟧.",
